@econ_policy_
title: Economic Policy
subtitle: Consider an economic plan.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if spd_in_government = 0 : <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> not in government: ?] [? if (economic_minister_party != "SPD" and fiscal_minister_party != "SPD") : The <span style="color: #c00000;">SPD</span> does not control a necessary ministry. ?] [? if economic_plan == 0 : We need a policy first. ?]
